# Theme: Sand
name      = Sand                 # the board's own name
group     = Solids               # its tier in the Tailor (themes/tiers.dat)
kind      = solid                # solid or pattern
base      = #e6d3a3              # the main board color

# The rest of the page while this theme is on
swirl     = [#ecc97c, #b88a46, #4a3418]  # bright, middle and deep paint colors
highlight = #ffd23f              # the accent color
particles = dust                 # what drifts over the page
emblem    = sun                  # its symbol in the Tailor
